  <h1>How do you add a dependency in Cabal?</h1>
  <div class="artmeta"><span>By Coldwast</span><span>Updated Aug 4, 2026</span><span>7 min read</span><span class="tag">#haskell</span><span class="tag">#cabal</span><span class="tag">#packages</span></div>
  <nav class="toc" id="toc"></nav>
  <figure>
    <img class="hero" src="https://cdn.pixabay.com/photo/2016/01/27/04/32/books-1163695_1280.jpg" alt="Tall stacks of second-hand books filling a bookshop aisle" width="1200" height="420" loading="eager" />
